---
import SectionWrapper from '../ui/SectionWrapper.astro';
---

<SectionWrapper background="light" class="our-work-section our-work-stories-section">
  <section id="stories" class="container container-wide our-work-content" aria-labelledby="stories-title">
    <header class="our-work-section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">05 / SELECTED STORIES</p>
        <h2 id="stories-title">The context behind the moments.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Photographs show where we have been. Stories explain what brought people together, what was explored, and what came next. Start with a few threads from the work.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="our-work-story-grid">
      <a class="our-work-story-card" href="#forums-events">
        <span class="our-work-story-index">01</span>
        <span class="our-work-story-type">FORUMS &amp; IDEAS</span>
        <strong>Making space for the future of learning.</strong>
        <span class="our-work-story-link">Explore forum highlights <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="our-work-story-card" href="#initiatives">
        <span class="our-work-story-index">02</span>
        <span class="our-work-story-type">INITIATIVES</span>
        <strong>Taking ideas into real learning environments.</strong>
        <span class="our-work-story-link">Explore initiatives <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="our-work-story-card" href="#partnerships">
        <span class="our-work-story-index">03</span>
        <span class="our-work-story-type">COLLABORATION</span>
        <strong>Building progress through shared effort.</strong>
        <span class="our-work-story-link">Explore partnerships <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SectionWrapper>
